```
This assert statement checks that the `LastIndexOf` method returns the same result as before when searching for `x` in the new array list (`arrList`).

9. In the `PUT_CountContract` method:
```cs
Assert.AreEqual(New_Ret, arrList.Count);
```
This assert statement checks that the `Count` property of the new array list (`arrList`) is equal to `New_Ret`.--------------------